---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy — Aaron Su" description="Privacy policy for aaronsuu.github.io.">
  <section class="pv-w">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p class="pv-meta">Last updated October 26, 2026</p>

    <h2>Information collected</h2>
    <p>This site does not require accounts and does not ask for personal information. Basic, anonymous usage data, such as pages visited, referring sites, browser type, and approximate location, may be collected to understand how the site is used.</p>

    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>This site uses privacy-focused analytics that do not use cookies and do not track you across other websites.</p>

    <h2>Third-party services</h2>
    <p>This site relies on third-party services for hosting, fonts, and analytics. These providers may process standard technical information, such as your IP address, to deliver their services, under their own privacy policies.</p>

    <h2>Local storage</h2>
    <p>Display preferences, like light or dark theme, are saved in your browser and never leave your device.</p>

    <h2>Data sharing</h2>
    <p>Your information is never sold, rented, or shared for advertising.</p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>This policy may be updated from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about this policy can be sent through the contact links on the <a href="/">home page</a>.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
